  "title": "從 FB 垃圾山挖寶",
  "summary": "昨天在我的 Facebook 備份裡面考古，挖出了許多 2010 年代的有趣東西：",
  "content": "<p>昨天在我的 Facebook 備份裡面考古，挖出了許多 2010 年代的有趣東西：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>🎲 <strong>很隨機的</strong>：古時候的 <a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/hello-kitty-badges\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">7-11 Hello Kitty 徽章</a>、我被 FB <a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/fb-too-controlling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">禁止按讚</a>兩天、LG 螢幕<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/broken-lg-monitor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">整個斷掉</a>、<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/cat-eats-shrimp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">吃蝦不吐殼</a>的貓（有影片）、把蚊子<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/killing-mosquito\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">電爆</a>（也有影片）。</li>\n<li>💙 <strong>以前很喜歡的大耳狗</strong>：<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/nanoblock-cinnamoroll\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">迷你積木</a>、<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/cinnamoroll-luggage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">行李箱</a>、<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/cinnamoroll-2017\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">三麗鷗角色大賞</a>。</li>\n<li>🌱 <strong>成長記錄</strong>：2007 年<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/2007-practice-recording\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">在家練琴</a>的錄音、好和弦頻道<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/project-nicechord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">開張當天</a>、好和弦<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/nicechord-10000-subs\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破一萬訂閱</a>、林宥嘉〈兜圈〉<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/yogalin-detour\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">上線那天</a>、<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/musictest-1m-plays\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">一百萬人次</a>完成音樂能力測驗。</li>\n<li>🗡️ <strong>離婚冒險遊戲</strong>：<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/not-a-rant\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">負面文</a>、煩到<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/ugh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">找 Siri 討拍</a>、另一篇<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/trash-can\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">負面文</a>，以及成功離婚<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/taipei-2017-universiade\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">破關那天</a>的記錄。</li>\n<li>📸 <strong>相簿</strong>：<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/bravo-bear\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">熊讚</a>也太白痴、<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/evernote-book\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Evernote</a> 曾經很好用、我曾經很熱衷參加 <a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/2017-youtube-party\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">YouTube 的活動</a>。</li>\n<li>©️ <strong>依然沒變的事</strong>：YouTube 用<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/i-am-gould\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">版權砲</a>轟炸我、樂理考題<a href=\"https://wiwi.blog/blog/what-key-is-this\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">出得很爛</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>其實都滿廢的啦，但這裡是我的 blog，我愛放什麼就放什麼！打理自己的垃圾山很療癒呀！</p>",
